"Delete everything":"Padam semua",
"Type your LENA password.":"Taip kata laluan LENA awak.",
"That password is not right. Forgot it? Sign out, then choose Forgot password? on the sign-in screen.":"Kata laluan itu tidak betul. Terlupa? Log keluar, kemudian pilih Lupa kata laluan? di skrin log masuk.",
