"If you sign in to a LENA account, with Google or with your email, it is also backed up to that account, so it is there on any device you sign in on.":"Kalau awak log masuk ke akaun LENA, dengan Google atau dengan e-mel awak, ia turut disandarkan ke akaun itu, jadi ia ada pada mana-mana peranti yang awak log masuk.",
"If you continue as a guest, what you log stays in this browser, on this device. If you sign in to a LENA account, with Google or with your email, it is also backed up to that account, so it is there on any device you sign in on. You can delete it all at any time in Privacy & Data.":"Kalau awak teruskan sebagai tetamu, apa yang awak rekod kekal dalam pelayar ini, dalam peranti ini. Kalau awak log masuk ke akaun LENA, dengan Google atau dengan e-mel awak, ia turut disandarkan ke akaun itu, jadi ia ada pada mana-mana peranti yang awak log masuk. Awak boleh padam semuanya bila-bila masa di Privasi & Data.",
"This stays on your device, and in your LENA account if you are signed in to one. Write it in your own words, for yourself.":"Ini kekal dalam peranti awak, dan dalam akaun LENA awak kalau awak log masuk ke akaun. Tulis dengan kata-kata awak sendiri, untuk diri awak.",
"Journal entries are saved on this device. If you are signed in to a LENA account, they are also backed up to it. They are never shown to anyone else.":"Catatan jurnal disimpan dalam peranti ini. Kalau awak log masuk ke akaun LENA, ia turut disandarkan ke akaun itu. Ia tidak pernah ditunjukkan kepada sesiapa.",
"Signed in to a LENA account":"Log masuk ke akaun LENA",
"There are two exceptions. Messages you send to LENA AI go to an AI service so it can write a reply, and so do the items in a plan when you tap Help me order.":"Ada dua pengecualian. Mesej yang awak hantar kepada AI LENA dihantar kepada perkhidmatan AI supaya ia boleh menulis balasan, begitu juga item dalam pelan apabila awak tekan Bantu saya susun.",
"You are signed in to a LENA account, so your mood entries, sleep log, journal, screening results, safety plan and settings are also backed up to your LENA account on LENA's server. That is how they reach your other devices. They are never shown to anyone else. Delete everything below removes them there too.":"Awak log masuk ke akaun LENA, jadi rekod mood, log tidur, jurnal, keputusan saringan, pelan keselamatan dan tetapan awak turut disandarkan ke akaun LENA awak di pelayan LENA. Begitulah ia sampai ke peranti awak yang lain. Ia tidak pernah ditunjukkan kepada sesiapa. Padam semua di bawah turut memadamnya di sana.",
"You are not signed in to a LENA account, so nothing else leaves this device. Your mood entries, sleep log, journal, screening results and safety plan are not uploaded.":"Awak tidak log masuk ke akaun LENA, jadi tiada apa-apa lagi yang keluar dari peranti ini. Rekod mood, log tidur, jurnal, keputusan saringan dan pelan keselamatan awak tidak dimuat naik.",
'Already have a LENA account with this email? Then the email has no code. It tells you how to sign in instead.':'Sudah ada akaun LENA dengan e-mel ini? Jika ya, e-mel itu tiada kod. Ia memberitahu cara untuk log masuk.',
